  "inShort": "With no playable evidence, the goal is at risk. It is unknown what got done, because nothing was shown. The main risk is leaving co-op sailing and the five-player test unproven.",
  "discussed": [],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [],
  "questions": [
    "What can you show now that makes the tide loop and co-op sailing playable?",
    "How will building two islands and testing with five players fit the 40–60 hours?"
  ],
  "lenses": {
    "marketing": "No public devlog means no audience response to assess through applause or views; no store or game link is listed.",
    "team": "The stated 10–15 hours weekly gives this solo plan 40–60 hours, but one sprint cannot establish pace. The founder joined on October 30, after this review period, so that membership does not establish who worked during the sprint.",
    "management": "No tasks or artifacts establish progress toward the 28-day slice, so the path from prototype to demo and release remains unproven. A sprint without visible evidence is common and can be corrected within this checkpoint."
  }
}

